  note      = {the 402 revival as a wire protocol},
  note-zh   = {把 402 复活成线上协议},
  tldr    = {Revives HTTP 402 as a concrete protocol: a server prices the request, the client retries with a signed stablecoin payment in a header, and a facilitator settles on-chain.},
